<title>UK: LIFFE coffee at new high, cocoa firms, sugar down.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee at new high, cocoa firms, sugar down.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Rises to new high one-yr after lacklustre opening. July up $32 at $1,849 at 0947 GMT</p>
<p>COCOA - Firms after opening down. July just above psychological 1,000 stg level at 1,001 stg, up one.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Lower on profit taking after recent rally. Volume thin.</p>
<p>August 90 cents lower at $317.50</p>
</text>
